{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1590","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"痴儿了却公家事，快阁东西倚晚晴。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"落木千山天远大，澄江一道月分明。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"朱弦已为佳人绝，青眼聊因美酒横。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"万里归船弄长笛，此心吾与白鸥盟。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔痴儿了却公家事〕意思是自己办完了公事。《晋书·傅咸传》载，杨济与傅咸书云：“生子痴，了官事。官事未易了，了事正作痴，复为快耳。”此句借用其意，自嘲“痴儿”忙于公事。痴儿，痴人、呆子，这里是诗人自指。\n\n〔倚〕这里指倚栏欣赏。\n\n〔朱弦已为佳人绝〕这是借“伯牙绝弦”的典故慨叹世无知己。朱弦，指琴。佳人，指知己。\n\n〔青眼聊因美酒横〕这是说唯有美酒值得加以青眼。《晋书·阮籍传》载，阮籍善为青白眼，用白眼看世俗礼法之士，用青眼看他喜欢的人。横，睨视、斜着眼看。\n\n〔与白鸥盟〕这是说与白鸥订盟，表示自己决意归隐江湖，而不存世俗机心。盟，订盟、盟誓。《列子·黄帝》载，海边有一人常和鸥鸟玩耍，其父让他把鸥鸟捉来与自己玩。第二天此人来到海边，鸥鸟在空中飞舞而不落下。后人常用与鸥订盟表示归隐之志已决，再无俗念牵挂。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"云收雨歇，天色向晚，诗人登快阁倚栏游赏，看起来十分寻常，可开篇自称了却官事的痴儿，便让诗作带上了一些自嘲、兀傲之气。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"接下来，作者用树、山、天、江、月勾画出一个阔大幽远的境界，为抒发情志作好了准备。在颈联和尾联中，诗人感慨知音难觅，唯幸美酒相伴，期望坐上归船，吹着长笛，与白鸥订盟，相誓归隐，永诀机心。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"诗歌每联上下两句恪守格律，意脉却不受影响，一气而下，被誉为“能移太白歌行于律诗”（清方东树《续昭昧詹言》），诵读时可以细细体会。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"},{"runs":[{"alt":"This is","mediaId":"media-6f11db199c1e659ba1cb","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"alt":"An old book with yellowed pages is opened to display columns of traditional Chinese characters written vertically.","mediaId":"media-fe36e298fb293937ed63","type":"media-ref"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=65609","provider":"ctext","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=65609","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","type":"resource-link"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《山谷外集诗注》卷十一（《黄庭坚诗集注》，中华书局2003 年版）。\n\n黄庭坚（1045—1105），字鲁直，号山谷道人、涪翁，洪州分宁（今江西修水）人，北宋文学家、书法家。快阁，在太和（今江西泰和）东的赣江边。这首诗作于宋神宗元丰五年（1082）秋，诗人时任太和县令。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=65609","sourceUrl":"https://ctext.org/wiki.pl?if=gb&chapter=65609","text":"開啟中國哲學書電子化計劃原文","title":null},{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e7%99%bb%e5%bf%ab%e9%98%81-%e9%bb%84%e5%ba%ad%e5%9d%9a","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e7%99%bb%e5%bf%ab%e9%98%81-%e9%bb%84%e5%ba%ad%e5%9d%9a","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/%e9%81%b8%e5%bf%85%e4%b8%8b/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e7%99%bb%e5%bf%ab%e9%98%81-%e9%bb%84%e5%ba%ad%e5%9d%9a","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"An old book with yellowed pages is opened to display columns of traditional Chinese characters written vertically.","bytes":237767,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/1/16b20e3d39de422c80693694dcfa0dcbd561a558.jpeg","height":950,"id":"media-fe36e298fb293937ed63","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"2f816698cd59e056990340b95f53180c6ccb2bc91c93d521c9fda69b3ab6d2dc","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/1/16b20e3d39de422c80693694dcfa0dcbd561a558.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":1280},{"alt":"","bytes":458657,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/1/1ec1db67aeafc3f5e5f02dc663ad362c04359fe5.jpeg","height":1987,"id":"media-7316a2daeb582ca889dc","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"c0ac6415e4fa0f2e